  "title": "Holly&#39;s Shrimp Corn Bread",
  "description": "Classic corn bread gets a flavor upgrade in this Panasonic CIO recipe that includes shrimp, sharp Cheddar cheese, jalapeno peppers, and Creole seasoning.",
